| `check_S` roster parity | Refuses a README `## What ships here` table that disagrees with its directory or has an empty `Not for` cell, a README `rosters.readmes` lists that lacks the table, and a README with the table that the list does not name. HTML block types 1 to 7 are blanked, preserving a roster after a type-6 or type-7 blank-line ending. | `make check` | [`rosters.readmes`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | A README the list does not name and that has no heading is not judged. | [doc-style.md](../guides/doc-style.md) | always |
